      "role": "user",
      "content": "it feels so weird. like i'm still walking around and eating and sleeping, but the version of me that actually mattered is just... gone. everyone has moved on and i'm just a ghost in all these old threads and chats. i feel like i'm just playing a role for a person who doesn't even exist anymore.",
